List of authors of code contained in BusyBox-RS.

If you have contributed code to BusyBox-RS, you should be listed here.
Please keep this file updated as new applets and modules are authored.

-----------

BusyBox-RS Contributors <busybox-rust@users.noreply.github.com>
    Initial Rust rewrite architecture, modular Applet trait dispatcher,
    Linux/POSIX syscall abstraction layer, raw OsStr/byte stream engine.

Applets & Subsystems:
    - Core utils: echo, true, false, pwd, printenv, sleep, yes, clear, reset
    - File utils: ls, cp, mv, rm, mkdir, rmdir, touch, link, unlink, dirname, basename, which
    - Text utils: cat, head, tail, wc, fold, rev, expand, unexpand
    - Stream & Filters: cut, tr, sort, grep, uniq, comm, tee, strings
    - Encoding: uuencode, uudecode, xxd
    - Math & Analysis: seq, factor, tsort
    - Shell: sh (modular AST / executor)
    - Embedded sizing & optimization profile (z-opt, LTO, panic-abort, symbol strip)
